OL,3,GNEWSA'If you can bring litter to the
OL,4,ADales, you can take it away'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is an iconic hiking route showing
OL,7,Foff Yorkshire's beauty from three of
OL,8,Fits highest peaks. The 24-mile (38.6km)
OL,9,FYorkshire Three Peaks walk, with its
OL,10,F5000ft (1600m) of vertical ascent, is
OL,11,Fundertaken by tens of thousands of
OL,12,Fpeople every year.
OL,14,FBut those living near the route - which
OL,15,Fclimbs Whernside, Ingleborough and
OL,16,FPen-y-ghent - have reported issues such
OL,17,Fas overcrowding, problem parking and
OL,18,Fpublic urination for many years.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
