OL,3,GNEWSA'If you can bring litter to the
OL,4,ADales, you can take it away'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new campaign has now been started by
OL,7,Fa group of Brownies and Guides,
OL,8,Ftackling another common complaint -
OL,9,Flitter.
OL,11,F"It's just annoying because people
OL,12,Fshould take it home with them," says
OL,13,Fnine-year-old Ivy.
